
### Login - executar primeiro
# @name login
POST http://localhost:40000/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "user1",
    "password": "1234"
}

###

@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Cadastrar médico
POST http://localhost:40000/insertMedico
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "nome": "Ana Silva",
    "crm": "CRM-SP-12345",
    "especialidade": "Clínica médica"
}

###

### Listar médicos
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllMedicos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Buscar médico por ID
GET http://localhost:40000/getMedicoByID/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Atualizar médico
PUT http://localhost:40000/updateMedico/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "nome": "Ana Silva",
    "crm": "CRM-SP-12345",
    "especialidade": "Cardiologia"
}

###

### Cadastrar consulta
POST http://localhost:40000/insertConsulta
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "paciente_nome": "João Pereira",
    "data_consulta": "2026-11-04",
    "valor": 180.50,
    "realizada": false,
    "medico_id": 1
}

###

### Listar consultas
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllConsultas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Buscar consulta por ID
GET http://localhost:40000/getConsultaByID/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Atualizar consulta
PUT http://localhost:40000/updateConsulta/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "paciente_nome": "João Pereira",
    "data_consulta": "2026-11-05",
    "valor": 200,
    "realizada": true,
    "medico_id": 1
}

###

### Teste de ID inválido - esperado: 400
GET http://localhost:40000/getMedicoByID/abc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Teste sem JWT - esperado: 401
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllConsultas

###

### Excluir consulta logicamente
DELETE http://localhost:40000/deleteConsulta/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Excluir médico logicamente
DELETE http://localhost:40000/deleteMedico/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
